-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Nov 16 2026 - Rodrigo Brito <183213+britors@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.1.0: first package. Detects the NVIDIA card and the driver branch
  from the forum guide (G07 for Turing and newer, G06 for Maxwell,
  Pascal and Volta), installs it from the official NVIDIA repository
  after verifying the signing key, tests it after the reboot and can
  update, reinstall or remove it. Privileged actions run through
  lyra-driver-helper with pkexec (polkit org.lyraos.driver.manage).
  Refuses G06 with Secure Boot on; migrates the old lyra-nvidia
  integration in one transaction.
- The window icon is now its own PNG, drawn from the app's SVG.
